| integer key | actually inserted | probe positions | probe bit values | query result |
| ---: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 10 | true | [10, 1, 8] | [1, 1, 1] | true |
| 20 | true | [12, 11, 10] | [1, 1, 1] | true |
| 22 | false | [10, 11, 12] | [1, 1, 1] | true |
